{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56837","headline":"贾真人壁间留诗（题拟） · 不详","name":"贾真人壁间留诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此後不知谁有分，壁间留得上天梯。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一八六《巴州》）（〖1〗《舆地纪胜》：「贾真人，唐人，居难江之紫极宫，白昼登仙，留诗壁间云〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}